<title>USA: International Technology names DeLuca CEO.</title>
<headline>International Technology names DeLuca CEO.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Technology Corp said Thursday its board of directors has unanimously appointed Anthony DeLuca chief executive.</p>
<p>DeLuca had been serving as acting chief executive since July 1996.  He will continue to hold the additional post of president, the company said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
